    "collapsible_content_8axDV6": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_iDfRCC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Authenticity",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>At Circular Fash, authenticity is more than a promise. It’s our mission.</strong></p><p>We are passionately committed to offering only genuine pre-owned designer pieces. Every item in our collection undergoes a meticulous, multi-step authentication process to ensure it meets the highest standards of quality and legitimacy.</p><p><strong>Expert Authentication</strong><br/>Our team of trained specialists, experts in luxury fashion, carefully inspects each item. From stitching and materials to logos, tags, and serial numbers, every detail is thoroughly examined to confirm authenticity.</p><p><strong>Trusted Sourcing</strong><br/>At Circular Fash, we collaborate exclusively with reputable resellers and verified sources known for their integrity and consistent track records with genuine designer goods. Our strict sourcing policies guarantee that only authentic pieces make it into our inventory.</p><p><strong>Customer Confidence</strong><br/>Your trust is our priority. That’s why every purchase is backed by our authenticity guarantee. If any item is ever discovered to be counterfeit, we offer a full refund, no questions asked.</p><p>When you choose Circular Fash, you’re not just embracing sustainable fashion. You are investing in verified luxury, responsible choices, and total peace of mind.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6R88ML": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Refresh",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Our Process – Refreshing Every Piece </strong></p><p>At <strong>Circularfash</strong>, we carefully ensure that every item feels fresh and well-cared-for before it’s listed for sale. When a piece arrives, we first inspect it thoroughly for any damage, wear, or stains 🔍.</p><p>Next, we clean each item according to its material and needs. We use professional steaming to remove unwanted odors and refresh both the inside and outside of the garment 🌬️. Steaming also helps reduce bacteria, leaving your pre-owned designer pieces feeling revitalized. If necessary, items are machine-washed or spot-cleaned for the best results 🧼.</p><p>Every jacket, sweatshirt, t-shirt, hat, shoes, or other designer item goes through this process before being showcased on our webshop. This ensures that every piece you purchase from <strong>Circular Fash</strong> is carefully inspected, professionally refreshed, and ready for its next chapter ✨.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6B49X8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Delivery Time",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>At <strong>Circular Fash</strong>, we’re committed to delivering your favorite pieces quickly, safely, and hassle-free, no matter where you are in the world.</p><p><strong>🇸🇪 Free Shipping in Sweden</strong><br/>Spend over <strong>2500 SEK</strong> and enjoy <strong>free tracked shipping</strong> right to your door.</p><p><strong>🚚 Fast Domestic Delivery (Sweden):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Free Tracked Delivery:</strong> Get your order in <strong>1–2 working days</strong></li></ul><p><strong>🌍 Worldwide Shipping</strong></p><ul><li>We ship globally using Postnord international and domestic.</li><li><strong>No customs fees</strong> – international customers can shop with confidence!</li><li>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout based on your location.</li></ul><p><strong>📦 Same-Day Dispatch</strong><br/>Place your order before 3:30 PM<strong> (CET)</strong> and we’ll ship it out the <strong>same day</strong>, Monday to Friday.</p><p>Enjoy a smooth, stylish, and stress-free delivery experience with Circular Fash. Your next designer piece is just a click away.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
